<figure class="cache-figure" data-cache-hierarchy>
 <p class="figure-title">A change has to cross every copy boundary</p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><button data-back>Previous copy step</button><button data-next>Next copy step</button><button data-reset>Reset copies</button></div>
 <p data-stage class="cluster-stage"></p>
 <div class="hierarchy-source">Authoritative source <strong data-source>12</strong></div>
 <div class="hierarchy-link">↓ application load / invalidation</div>
 <div class="hierarchy-shared">Shared Redis · L2 <strong data-redis>12</strong></div>
 <div class="hierarchy-branches"><div><span data-link-a>↓ tracking</span><div class="recovery-node"><b>Process A · L1</b><strong data-a>12</strong><small data-pending-a></small></div></div><div><span data-link-b>↓ tracking</span><div class="recovery-node" data-b-box><b>Process B · L1</b><strong data-b>12</strong><small data-pending-b></small></div></div></div>
 <p class="cluster-command" data-answer></p><p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Follow a fixed schedule through two independent application processes. Both local caches start warm. Delayed delivery and an observed connection loss are explicit events, not measured timings. The refill is an application source load followed by a Redis write; only the later tracked read populates B’s L1. This is a model, not live Redis traffic.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import{hierarchySteps}from'../../lib/caching/tracking.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-cache-hierarchy]').forEach(root=>{let step=0;const render=()=>{const s=hierarchySteps[step];root.querySelector('[data-stage]')!.textContent=`${step+1} / ${hierarchySteps.length} · ${s.title}`;for(const k of['source','redis','a','b']as const)root.querySelector(`[data-${k}]`)!.textContent=String(s[k]??'Empty');root.querySelector('[data-link-b]')!.textContent=s.connected?'↓ tracking':'× disconnected';root.querySelector('[data-b-box]')!.classList.toggle('recovery-offline',!s.connected);for(const name of['A','B'])root.querySelector(`[data-pending-${name.toLowerCase()}]`)!.textContent=s.pending.includes(name)?'Invalidation in flight':'No pending notification';root.querySelector('[data-answer]')!.textContent=s.answer;root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=s.note;root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-back]')!.disabled=step===0;root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-next]')!.disabled=step===hierarchySteps.length-1;};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-next]')!.onclick=()=>{step=Math.min(step+1,hierarchySteps.length-1);render();};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-back]')!.onclick=()=>{step=Math.max(0,step-1);render();};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.onclick=()=>{step=0;render();};render();});
</script>
